      "message": "how does this interact with the pair you just added? IMO I feel like the dstTextureSampler you added should only be used in the case where we can directly sample the texture we\u0027re rendering to. In that case is there reason to even pass in the Texture* here since we know it should be the same as the colorTexture?",
